# F3, INV's key of Find text, is none of INVWIN's, with SHIFT, CTRL or
# ALT or alone; the fields take at most LINK_USERLEN user name and
# LINK_PWMAX password characters.
# a 10-character user name and a 17-character password
T ABCDEFGHIJ
K TAB
T abcdefghijklmnopq
S K0
K STAB BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS
T ADMIN
K TAB BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS BS
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S K1
K SHIFT-F3
S K2
K CTRL-F3
S K3
K ALT-F3
S K4
# F3 alone does nothing either: then Search > Find text's search
# dialog, which ESC leaves
K F3 ALT-S T
S K5
K ESC
# the password dialog: 17 characters in each field
K ALT-O P
T abcdefghijklmnopq
K TAB
T ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQ
K TAB
T ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQ
S K6
K ESC
K ALT-F X
